Subject: lithium: built-in hfs-556.100.11 filesystem for XNU7195

Reuse ios-sailfish 6f27e41ff249f2680540ebe8ee5ab982c5e641c9 registration from 0026.
Only registers HFS; no device write or root selection in this patch.

